msgid ""
"**Description**: Search ClinicalTrials.gov for clinical trials by "
"disease/condition, drug/intervention, or keywords. This is the PRIMARY "
"tool for finding clinical trials — use it when you need to discover "
"trials for a drug (e.g., 'olaparib', 'pembrolizumab'), a disease (e.g., "
"'lung cancer', 'diabetes'), or any study criteria. Accepts condition "
"names, intervention/treatment names, and free-text queries. Returns NCT "
"IDs and brief descriptions with pagination. Use the returned NCT IDs with"
" 'get\\_clinical\\_trial\\_\\*' tools for detailed protocol info, or "
"'extract\\_clinical\\_trial\\_\\*' tools for efficacy/safety results. "
"Limited to trials beyond phase 1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:595
#: 7c3f648f3e9c48b09e0b8f6732dcbdd9
msgid ""
"``condition`` (string) (optional) Query for condition or disease using "
"Essie expression syntax (e.g., 'lung cancer', '(head OR neck) AND pain "
"AND NOT \"back pain\"')."
msgstr ""
"``condition``（字符串）（可选） 使用 Essie 表达式语法查询病症或疾病（例如，'lung cancer'，'(head OR "
"neck) AND pain AND NOT \"back pain\"'）。"

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:598
#: 43f868ccb860487995a4515c957e2a6f
msgid ""
"``intervention`` (string) (optional) Query for intervention/treatment "
"using Essie expression syntax (e.g., 'chemotherapy', 'immunotherapy', "
"'olaparib', 'combination therapy')."
msgstr ""
"``intervention``（字符串）（可选） 使用 Essie "
"表达式语法查询干预/治疗（例如，‘化疗’、‘免疫治疗’、‘奥拉帕利’、‘联合治疗’）。"

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:601
#: 6c9949ea397b42b9b0d276438cc5bced
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``query_term`` (string) (optional) Query for 'other terms' with Essie "
"expression syntax (e.g., 'combination', "
"'AREA[LastUpdatePostDate]RANGE[2023-01-15,MAX]', 'Phase II'). Can be used"
" to search for all other protocol fields, including but not limited to "
"title, outcome measures, status, phase, location, etc."
msgstr ""
"``query_term``（字符串）（可选） "
"使用Essie表达式语法查询“其他术语”（例如，'combination'、'AREA[LastUpdatePostDate]RANGE[2023-01-15,MAX]'、'Phase"
" II'）。可用于搜索所有其他协议字段，包括但不限于标题、结果指标、状态、阶段、地点等。"

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:604
#: 167e043c2dba4ed58ae5cc2a2b703335
msgid ""
"``pageSize`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of studies to return per"
" page (default 10, max 1000)."
msgstr "``pageSize``（整数）（可选）每页返回的最大研究数量（默认值为10，最大值为1000）。"

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:607
#: 2c981dd025fc4bf99b5912a33f25d5b9
msgid ""
"``pageToken`` (string) (optional) Token to retrieve the next page of "
"results, obtained from the 'nextPageToken' field of the previous "
"response. Do not specify it for first page. When you make an initial "
"request to the API which supports pagination, the response will include a"
" nextPageToken. This token can then be used as a parameter in the "
"subsequent API request to retrieve the next set of data."
msgstr ""
"``pageToken``（字符串）（可选）用于获取下一页结果的令牌，取自前一次响应中的 `nextPageToken` "
"字段。首次请求时无需指定该参数。当您首次调用支持分页的 API 时，响应中会包含一个 `nextPageToken`。该令牌可作为后续 API "
"请求的参数，用于获取下一批数据。"

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:610
#: 911eba21dcf14f5ba2597fdc90c02d51
msgid ""
"``overall_status`` (array) (optional) Filter by overall study status "
"(e.g., ['RECRUITING'], ['COMPLETED'], ['RECRUITING', "
"'NOT\\_YET\\_RECRUITING']). Valid values: RECRUITING, "
"NOT\\_YET\\_RECRUITING, ACTIVE\\_NOT\\_RECRUITING, COMPLETED, "
"ENROLLING\\_BY\\_INVITATION, SUSPENDED, TERMINATED, WITHDRAWN."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:613
#: e87098a7a98a4a98b5b6ff22d07070ef
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of studies to return "
"(alias for pageSize, default 10, max 1000)."
msgstr "``pageSize``（整数）（可选）每页返回的最大研究数量（默认值为10，最大值为1000）。"

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:616
#: 20ae86a88a9642a59b39fbdb515edfec
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Alias for max\\_results: maximum number of"
" studies to return (default 10, max 1000)."
msgstr "``pageSize``（整数）（可选）每页返回的最大研究数量（默认值为10，最大值为1000）。"

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:619
#: 7d66b282d96c4ea9a8603d40d78c656d
msgid ""
"``status`` (unknown) (optional) Alias for overall\\_status. Filter by "
"trial status, e.g. \"RECRUITING\", \"COMPLETED\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/clinicaltrials_gov_tools.rst:622
#: 3d5d4cc4a46e4caea6af1aa5e6513ad4
msgid ""
"``keyword`` (string) (optional) Alias for query\\_term. Free-text keyword"
